<style>
  {% include "/credits/credits.css" %}
</style>


<div class="credits-grid">
  {% for channel in channels %}
    <a href="{{ channel.url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="credits-card-link">
      <div class="credits-card">
        <p class="channel-name">{{ channel.name }}</p>
      </div>
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="more-credits">
<p>
  Please show support for the channels that made this project possible by uploading their VODS.
</p>
  <p>
    If you know more channels that you would like to see added, feel free to create an
    <a href="https://github.com/WhiteTPoison/projectplusvods/issues/new">issue</a> on GitHub.
  </p>

  <p>Special thanks:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://github.com/akbiggs/vods2" rel="noopener noreferrer">akbiggs and the vods2 contributors</a>
      (including <a href="https://github.com/Lumi-sg" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lumi</a> and
      <a href="https://github.com/dwinings" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wisp</a>) for the original Rivals of Aether 2 VOD site this is based on.
    </li>
    <li>
      The <a href="https://projectplusgame.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">Project+ team</a> for the game, character icons and logo.
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>